Anthropology#,#Anthropology#,#HASS Concentration in Anthropology#,#Concentration in Anthropology

A concentration in Anthropology requires three subjects including one introductory course and two other subjects.

intro_req, "Introductory Anthropology" := 21A.00 / 21A.01 / 21A.157

culture_politics, "Culture, Politics, and Identities" := 21A.103/21A.104, 21A.111/21A.120, 21A.127/21A.129, 21A.130/21A.131, 21A.132/21A.133, 21A.135/21A.136, 21A.137/21A.138, 21A.141/21A.143, 21A.144/21A.150, 21A.155/21A.461

health_environment, "Bodies, Health, and Environment" := 21A.301/21A.302, 21A.303/21A.305, 21A.311/21A.312, 21A.319/21A.400, 21A.402/21A.404, 21A.407/21A.408, 21A.409/21A.410, 21A.411/21A.419, 21A.429

sci_tech_media, "Science, Technology, and Media" := 21A.151/21A.500, 21A.501/21A.502, 21A.503/21A.504, 21A.505/21A.506, 21A.507/21A.508, 21A.509/21A.511, 21A.513/21A.519, 21A.520/21A.525, 21A.529/21A.539, 21A.550/21A.559

additional_anthro, "Additional Anthropology Courses" := culture_politics / health_environment / sci_tech_media

two_additional, "Two Additional Anthropology Subjects" := (additional_anthro){>=2}

total, "Total Requirements" := intro_req, two_additional

